"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"seems like you just upgraded இருந்து the free version. Once you அரே happy with this one and maybe migrated your அமைப்புகள் and favorites over, you can uninstall the old free one பெறுநர் avoid launching it accidentally அச் you will not need it anymore, it will also prevent this dialog இருந்து showing up.\n"
"\n"
