#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "upgraded_to_pro_gallery"
msgid ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"seems like you already have the Pro app version too. Once you are happy with it and maybe migrated your settings and favorites over, you can uninstall this one to avoid launching it accidentally as you will not need it anymore.\n"
"\n"
